{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c3e0e397405d685519a2a27ce5359329d9c12b00d8ad8f723b7af1d506addff8","ja":"ハロウィンライブは絶好調！","zh":"万圣节演唱会状态绝佳！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"db53005a68265ea8ad71ea2ece16cda43e86c4ade116eeaff930b65d3a74793e","ja":"ひなた、可奈、紬は\nハロウィンライブに出演していて……","zh":"日向、可奈和紬\n去参加万圣节演唱会了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"218cf818f567e58d84574b241bb468d172da3e0e31e8bc7a6ba3bd5081cafc28","ja":"ハロウィンって、優しいオバケも怖いオバケも、\nたくさん来るそうなんだよぉ！","zh":"听说万圣节的时候，既会有温柔的幽灵，\n也会有可怕的幽灵，会来好多好多呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d86820aa7e6b61008ecb44c5acfb2754a97f1e2d444832f6579a76dbfeeba166","ja":"だから仮装して、\n悪～い霊は驚かせて、追い払うんだって！","zh":"所以要乔装打扮，\n把恶～灵吓跑才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"68ddd169d5d7c10c49679c355c19daa29e5f810191287ac256e399d040dfdbdb","ja":"でも仮装してなくても、みんなで盛り上がったら、\nオバケなんて追い払えちゃいそうですよね♪","zh":"不过就算不乔装打扮，只要大家一起热闹起来，\n感觉就连妖怪也能赶跑呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6ab56586044344b0bf4c4762446b9336323b31a133a1edc1db73d14e7c913c28","ja":"ええ。霊が現れても、私達で追い払って\nみせましょう。では次の曲、お聞きください！","zh":"嗯。就算幽灵出现，我们也一定会把它\n赶跑的。那么请听下一首歌！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4ef680235ab103ffea17fa93af99ad80abcd3aac6ee739135a6026a1e526ad05","ja":"ワアアアアアア～～～ッ！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊啊啊～～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"af3ece96afcee3b39befa4488a8c3e149af681730761ce245356c667bcf901b4","ja":"MCでも盛り上がっていただけましたね。\nハロウィンのことを調べておいて、よかったです。","zh":"主持环节大家也很尽兴呢。\n提前调查了万圣节的相关内容，真是太好了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"d7a4568f9c0c9e7decbc2002c19400a5519f887727e974613efccd131b287541","ja":"楽しんでもらえてよかったべさ。\nこのあとも、がんばらねば。","zh":"能让大家玩得开心真是太好了。\n接下来也得加油才行。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"116baa4620a10ca6bdb455609f88aeb51bd578cff264a506e26a91ce9c295208","ja":"次は、アンコール♪\n聞こえるみんなのラブコール♪","zh":"接下来是安可♪\n听到了大家的爱的呼唤♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"fd0939676f3f987f8420f020fb3bb8dad6104ec54f10c88fae138adef43b95eb","ja":"そしてその後は、\nハロウィンのお菓子のプレゼント、ですね。","zh":"然后在那之后，\n就是赠送万圣节糖果的环节，对吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"cbd0def8f6ff4fd3b8eddad2d404ccfc938045b0511aa21337d52d98a29fc79e","ja":"お菓子、お客さんにも気に入ってもらえるといいねぇ♪\nそれじゃあぼちぼち、ステージ袖に行くべさ。","zh":"点心要是也能合客人们的心意就好了呢♪\n那么差不多该去舞台侧幕候场啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"bdd2efe0a68c2c5c1370a5f7618649ef2c20e401fe668ac2654ebc978fbc0a76","ja":"昼公演、ラストまで頑張るぞ～！","zh":"日场公演，要全力坚持到最后哦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"a8785ef09d8a37df99b4f29de745be7fe32cf20dda623971b958595b6ddfb0bb","ja":"ガンッ！","zh":"砰！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1663.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"b8fbf6dc6a00c25e1227354619be4f7d7d27183f7a72ca6e18cafc5a6f8c8065","ja":"いたっ！　うう、イスにぶつかっちゃった……。\nわぁっ！？　な、なにかが落っこちそうに……！？","zh":"好痛！呜呜，撞到椅子了……。\n哇啊！？有、有什么东西好像要掉下来了……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
